# The context of the backend's two images (backend/Dockerfile and
# backend/Dockerfile.claims) is the repository root, because backend/go.mod
# replaces syndra/addons/strictjson with ../addons/strictjson: only those two
# directories go in. The UI and the add-ons build from contexts of their own.
*
!backend
!addons/strictjson
# What a local build or run leaves behind (the root .gitignore's list).
backend/bin
backend/api
backend/test
backend/syndra-token
backend/.gocache
backend/.gomodcache
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Secrets, should one sit inside an allowed directory (the root .gitignore's
# list, and a key file by its usual names): never into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/zitadel-machine-key.json
**/DEPLOY.local.md
